<div class="slim">
  <span class="t c">Held for review</span>
  <span class="w" style="color:rgba(20,23,28,.55)" data-slot="c-summary">-</span>
</div>

<div class="legend">
  <div>
    <h3>Tier scale</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><span class="lt" style="color:var(--red)">S</span><span>Drop everything: top fit and clear openness, source it before anything else.</span></li>
      <li><span class="lt" style="color:var(--green)">A</span><span>Act this run: strong fit or strong openness, start a name list.</span></li>
      <li><span class="lt" style="color:var(--gold-dk)">B</span><span>Watch: real signal, capped ceiling, recheck next run.</span></li>
      <li><span class="lt" style="color:var(--gray)">C</span><span>Ignored: kept visible so the call can be overruled.</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h3>Fit hexagon, axes clockwise from top</h3>
    <p><b style="color:var(--ink);font-weight:600">OP</b> openness to move · <b style="color:var(--ink);font-weight:600">RO</b> role fit · <b style="color:var(--ink);font-weight:600">PR</b> product fit · <b style="color:var(--ink);font-weight:600">RG</b> region fit · <b style="color:var(--ink);font-weight:600">SZ</b> size fit · <b style="color:var(--ink);font-weight:600">ST</b> stage fit. Vertex distance = High / Medium / Low against the three rings.</p>
  </div>
